| Keys + accounts | 1 ghanta |
| Phase 1–3 (setup, CRM client, email) | 3 ghante |
| Phase 4–5 (cycle + scheduler) | 4 ghante |
| Phase 6 (webhook test) | 15 min |
| Phase 7 (Claude chat agent) | 3–4 ghante |
| Testing + demo tayyari | 2 ghante |
| **Kul** | **~2 din** |

